+### Genérica (sin `segment`)
+
+```svg
+<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
